# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings even in a Windows checkout with
# `core.autocrlf=true`: copied to a Linux host with CRLF, `#!/usr/bin/env bash`
# becomes `bash\r` and the script does not start (deploy/proxy/redeploy.sh).
#
# Deliberately NOT a blanket `* text=auto` rule: that would renormalise every
# file in the tree.
*.sh text eol=lf
